---
import StaticPageLayout from "../layouts/StaticPageLayout.astro";

export const prerender = true;
---

<StaticPageLayout path="/gdpr-policy">
  <section class="bg-white py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4">
      <h1 class="mb-4 text-4xl font-heading font-bold text-kaizen-dark md:text-5xl">
        GDPR & Data Protection
      </h1>
      <p class="mb-12 text-kaizen-text-dark/60">Last updated: January 2024</p>

      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-kaizen-text-dark/80">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">Our Commitment to Data Protection</h2>
        <p>
          Kaizen Web is committed to protecting your personal data and your right to privacy.
          We comply with the UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">1. Legal Basis for Processing</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Consent:</strong> clear consent for specific processing.</li>
          <li><strong>Contract:</strong> necessary processing to perform a contract.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal obligation:</strong> required by law.</li>
          <li><strong>Legitimate interests:</strong> business interests that do not override your rights.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">2. Your Data Rights</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Right of access.</li>
          <li>Right to rectification.</li>
          <li>Right to erasure.</li>
          <li>Right to restrict processing.</li>
          <li>Right to data portability.</li>
          <li>Right to object.</li>
          <li>Rights related to automated decision-making.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">3. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
          We retain data only as long as necessary for service delivery and legal obligations.
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Contact information: business relationship duration plus up to 3 years.</li>
          <li>Website analytics: up to 26 months.</li>
          <li>Email communications: until unsubscribe or deletion request.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">4. Data Sharing & Third Parties</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell or rent personal data. We may share data with service providers under agreements and legal authorities where required.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">5. International Transfers</h2>
        <p>
          If data is transferred internationally, we use appropriate safeguards such as Standard Contractual Clauses.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use industry-standard security controls including encryption, secure infrastructure, and access controls.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">7. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
        <p>
          We use cookies for functionality and analytics. You can accept or reject non-essential cookies.
          See our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-semibold text-kaizen-cyan no-underline hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">8. Data Breach Notification</h2>
        <p>
          If a qualifying breach occurs, we notify affected parties and relevant authorities in line with UK GDPR requirements.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">9. Exercising Your Rights</h2>
        <p>
          Contact us to make a rights request. We aim to respond within 30 days.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Data Protection Contact</strong><br />
          privacy@kaizenweb.co.uk
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">10. Data Protection Officer</h2>
        <p>
          You can also raise concerns with the UK Information Commissioner's Office at
          <a href="https://ico.org.uk" class="font-semibold text-kaizen-cyan no-underline hover:underline"> ico.org.uk</a>.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-heading text-kaizen-dark">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy as our practices or legal requirements evolve.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</StaticPageLayout>
